<title>PHILIPPINES: Lepanto A shares jump 47.1 percent.</title>
<headline>Lepanto A shares jump 47.1 percent.</headline>
<text>
<p>MANILA, Aug 29 (Reuter) _ Class A shares of Lepanto Consolidated Mining Co surged 47.1 percent to 0.25 peso in early Manila trade on Thursday on reports it had found a new gold deposit, traders said.</p>
